{"page":601,"width":1717,"height":2585,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"15.6 원격 마일 시스템 665","words":[{"text":"15.6","x":1134,"y":166,"width":70,"height":21},{"text":"원격","x":1221,"y":164,"width":44,"height":26},{"text":"마일","x":1275,"y":164,"width":44,"height":26},{"text":"시스템","x":1329,"y":163,"width":68,"height":26},{"text":"665","x":1468,"y":160,"width":59,"height":29}]},{"text":"용 가능함을 공지하고, 정확하게 어느 자책이 경우, 어느 파일)과 어느 클라이언트인지","words":[{"text":"용","x":299,"y":291,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"가능함을","x":346,"y":292,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"공지하고,","x":484,"y":292,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"정확하게","x":629,"y":293,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"어느","x":759,"y":294,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"자책이","x":829,"y":292,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"경우,","x":946,"y":292,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"어느","x":1028,"y":291,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"파일)과","x":1103,"y":291,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"어느","x":1224,"y":291,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트인지","x":1299,"y":290,"width":224,"height":39}]},{"text":"를 명시한다. 파일은 보통 파티션이나 서브디레터리 레벨에서 명시된다. 주어진 클라이","words":[{"text":"를","x":300,"y":353,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"명시한다.","x":348,"y":352,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"파일은","x":496,"y":352,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"보통","x":600,"y":354,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"파티션이나","x":672,"y":353,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"서브디레터리","x":833,"y":351,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"레벨에서","x":1030,"y":351,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"명시된다.","x":1169,"y":351,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"주어진","x":1318,"y":351,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"클라이","x":1430,"y":352,"width":93,"height":37}]},{"text":"인트-서버 설비의 구현 상세에 따라 서버는 여러 클라이언트에게 서비스를 제공할 수","words":[{"text":"인트-서버","x":303,"y":412,"width":149,"height":36},{"text":"설비의","x":471,"y":412,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"구현","x":576,"y":413,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"상세에","x":649,"y":413,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"따라","x":752,"y":413,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"서버는","x":825,"y":412,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":930,"y":412,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트에게","x":1004,"y":411,"width":217,"height":37},{"text":"서비스를","x":1240,"y":412,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"제공할","x":1384,"y":411,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1494,"y":413,"width":34,"height":35}]},{"text":"있으며, 클라이언트 역시 여러 서버를 사용할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"있으며,","x":303,"y":472,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트","x":418,"y":473,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"역시","x":585,"y":472,"width":54,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":655,"y":473,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"서버를","x":724,"y":473,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"사용할","x":822,"y":472,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":922,"y":473,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":966,"y":472,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"서버는 대개 볼륨이나 디렉터리 수준에서 시용 가능한 파일을 명시한다. 클라이언트","words":[{"text":"서버는","x":363,"y":533,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"대개","x":470,"y":533,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"볼륨이나","x":542,"y":533,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":674,"y":533,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"수준에서","x":801,"y":533,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"시용","x":933,"y":532,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"가능한","x":1005,"y":533,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":1109,"y":533,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"명시한다.","x":1217,"y":533,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1365,"y":533,"width":163,"height":37}]},{"text":"신원 확인은 좀 더 어렵다. 클라이언트는 네트워크 이름이나 IP 주소 같은 다른 식별자","words":[{"text":"신원","x":304,"y":593,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"확인은","x":380,"y":593,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"좀","x":488,"y":594,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"더","x":534,"y":593,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"어렵다.","x":576,"y":592,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트는","x":686,"y":592,"width":178,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":878,"y":593,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"이름이나","x":1012,"y":593,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"IP","x":1147,"y":597,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"주소","x":1195,"y":595,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":1274,"y":594,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1352,"y":594,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"식별자","x":1431,"y":594,"width":97,"height":37}]},{"text":"로 확인할 수 있지만, 이런 것들은 해7J(spoofing, imitation)될 수 있다. 허가되지 않","words":[{"text":"로","x":302,"y":656,"width":32,"height":27},{"text":"확인할","x":349,"y":653,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":457,"y":653,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있지만,","x":504,"y":653,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"이런","x":617,"y":652,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"것들은","x":690,"y":653,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"해7J(spoofing,","x":791,"y":652,"width":212,"height":44},{"text":"imitation)될","x":1017,"y":654,"width":185,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1218,"y":655,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1266,"y":655,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"허가되지","x":1352,"y":655,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"않","x":1496,"y":655,"width":32,"height":37}]},{"text":"은 클라이언트는 스푸핑(叩oofing)을 이용하여 허가된 것처럼 위장해서 서버에 접속한","words":[{"text":"은","x":302,"y":714,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"클라이언트는","x":348,"y":713,"width":189,"height":36},{"text":"스푸핑(叩oofing)을","x":550,"y":712,"width":276,"height":43},{"text":"이용하여","x":839,"y":713,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"허가된","x":972,"y":714,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"것처럼","x":1077,"y":715,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"위장해서","x":1181,"y":715,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"서버에","x":1321,"y":716,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"접속한","x":1431,"y":716,"width":96,"height":35}]},{"text":"다. 더욱 안전한 해결 방안은 암호화된 기를 통하여 클라이언트에서 서버로 보안 인증을","words":[{"text":"다.","x":304,"y":773,"width":38,"height":35},{"text":"더욱","x":358,"y":773,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"안전한","x":434,"y":773,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"해결","x":539,"y":773,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"방안은","x":611,"y":772,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"암호화된","x":713,"y":773,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"기를","x":845,"y":774,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"통하여","x":915,"y":774,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트에서","x":1017,"y":775,"width":212,"height":36},{"text":"서버로","x":1246,"y":776,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"보안","x":1353,"y":776,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"인증을","x":1431,"y":776,"width":95,"height":36}]},{"text":"하는 것이다. 불행하게도 클라이언트와 서버의 호환성(같은 암호 알고리즘을 사용)과 안","words":[{"text":"하는","x":304,"y":833,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":382,"y":833,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"불행하게도","x":496,"y":832,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":660,"y":833,"width":182,"height":36},{"text":"서버의","x":853,"y":834,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"호환성(같은","x":954,"y":834,"width":163,"height":38},{"text":"암호","x":1129,"y":835,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":1203,"y":835,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"사용)과","x":1373,"y":835,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"안","x":1494,"y":835,"width":33,"height":35}]},{"text":"전한 기 값의 교환(기 값을 가로채어 허가되지 않은 클라이언트가 접근을 시도할 수도","words":[{"text":"전한","x":305,"y":892,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"기","x":384,"y":893,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"값의","x":430,"y":892,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"교환(기","x":506,"y":892,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"값을","x":626,"y":892,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"가로채어","x":700,"y":892,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"허가되지","x":834,"y":894,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"않은","x":969,"y":894,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언트가","x":1042,"y":894,"width":185,"height":36},{"text":"접근을","x":1243,"y":895,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"시도할","x":1352,"y":895,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"수도","x":1461,"y":895,"width":65,"height":34}]},{"text":"있다) 등을 비롯한 많은 문제가 도처에 존재한다. 이러한 문제들을 해결하기 어렵기 때","words":[{"text":"있다)","x":306,"y":952,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"등을","x":394,"y":952,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"비롯한","x":472,"y":952,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":578,"y":952,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"문제가","x":652,"y":952,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"도처에","x":756,"y":953,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"존재한다.","x":859,"y":953,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":1004,"y":953,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"문제들을","x":1106,"y":953,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"해결하기","x":1243,"y":954,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"어렵기","x":1385,"y":953,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":1495,"y":953,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"문에 대부쁜 불안전한 인증 방법이 시용된다.","words":[{"text":"문에","x":303,"y":1011,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"대부쁜","x":381,"y":1011,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"불안전한","x":484,"y":1010,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"인증","x":622,"y":1011,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"방법이","x":691,"y":1011,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"시용된다.","x":793,"y":1012,"width":127,"height":36}]},{"text":"UNIX와 UNIX 네트워크 파일 시스템(NFS)의 경우, 기본적으로 클라이언트 네트","words":[{"text":"UNIX와","x":363,"y":1070,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"UNIX","x":502,"y":1073,"width":93,"height":28},{"text":"네트워크","x":610,"y":1070,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":744,"y":1071,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"시스템(NFS)의","x":818,"y":1071,"width":207,"height":38},{"text":"경우,","x":1042,"y":1071,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"기본적으로","x":1125,"y":1071,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1289,"y":1071,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"네트","x":1465,"y":1070,"width":63,"height":35}]},{"text":"워킹 정보를 통해 인증한다. 이러한 방법에서는 사용자 ID가 클라이언트와 서버에서 일","words":[{"text":"워킹","x":305,"y":1129,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"정보를","x":381,"y":1130,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"통해","x":487,"y":1129,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"인증한다.","x":564,"y":1129,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":706,"y":1130,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"방법에서는","x":809,"y":1130,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"사용자","x":971,"y":1130,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"ID가","x":1074,"y":1130,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":1155,"y":1130,"width":189,"height":35},{"text":"서버에서","x":1356,"y":1129,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"일","x":1500,"y":1129,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"지해야 한다. 그렇지 않다면 서버는 파일에 대한 접근 권한을 결정할 수 없다. 클라이언","words":[{"text":"지해야","x":306,"y":1189,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":413,"y":1189,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"그렇지","x":497,"y":1189,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"않다면","x":604,"y":1189,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"서버는","x":708,"y":1189,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"파일에","x":811,"y":1189,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":916,"y":1189,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"접근","x":989,"y":1189,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"권한을","x":1062,"y":1189,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"결정할","x":1167,"y":1189,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1269,"y":1190,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"없다.","x":1316,"y":1189,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언","x":1400,"y":1188,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"트에서 1000이라는 ID를, 서버에서 2000이라는 ID를 가지는 사용자의 예를 생각해 보","words":[{"text":"트에서","x":305,"y":1248,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"1000이라는","x":413,"y":1248,"width":166,"height":35},{"text":"ID를,","x":590,"y":1250,"width":78,"height":34},{"text":"서버에서","x":682,"y":1248,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"2000이라는","x":816,"y":1248,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"ID를","x":989,"y":1249,"width":70,"height":33},{"text":"가지는","x":1073,"y":1248,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"사용자의","x":1175,"y":1248,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"예를","x":1312,"y":1248,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"생각해","x":1388,"y":1248,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"보","x":1497,"y":1251,"width":33,"height":27}]},{"text":"자. 이 경우 클라이언트에서 서버로의 특정 파일 요청은 적절하게 처리되지 못한다. 서","words":[{"text":"자.","x":304,"y":1307,"width":39,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":362,"y":1307,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":408,"y":1307,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언트에서","x":482,"y":1307,"width":212,"height":37},{"text":"서버로의","x":713,"y":1308,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"특정","x":848,"y":1308,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":923,"y":1308,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"요청은","x":996,"y":1307,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":